    "description": "Product Overview:\nThis collection includes multiple vintage writing and calligraphy pen sets with various accessories. It features a Classic Pen Set in a black hard case containing stainless steel pens, colored ink refills, mechanical pencil leads, and additional tips. A wooden calligraphy box by Creswell (model MG030) holds glass dip pens, metal nibs, and an ink bottle. Additional items include a red model Ferrari 1957 pen holder on a wooden base, an Asian calligraphy paint and ink set in its original box, a boxed luxury pen with silver detailing, and a red fountain pen set with cartridges and replacement nibs.\n\nSpecifications:\n- Classic Pen Set in black hard case\n- Stainless steel pens\n- Colored ink refills\n- Mechanical pencil leads\n- Additional pen tips\n- Wooden calligraphy box by Creswell, model MG030, approx. 11.5 inches long\n- Glass dip pens\n- Metal nibs\n- Ink bottle\n- Red model Ferrari 1957 pen holder on wooden base\n- Boxed Asian calligraphy paint and ink set\n- Boxed luxury pen with ornate silver detailing\n- Red fountain pen set with cartridges and replacement nibs",
